# Atlas design system

Stack: React + Vite, Mantine 9, Recharts, react-router, `@untitledui/icons`, Inter Variable.

## Tokens only

- **Colors**: only the Atlas palette, via `var(--atlas-*)` in CSS or `atlasVar('token')` in TS. No hex values, Mantine color names or ad-hoc `color-mix` in components.
  - Surfaces: `background` (page and sidebar), `card`. Text: `text`, `textSecondary`. Brand: `primary`; `success` for E&P, `accent3` for Maritime.
  - Derived: `border` (Text 10%), `card-border` (8%), `hover` (8%), `divider` (6%).
  - `--atlas-hover` equals the **card color in dark mode**, so on card surfaces use `--atlas-border` for hovers (see `IconButton`).
- **Font sizes**: 10, 12, 14, 16, 20, 24 only, as `var(--mantine-font-size-xxs|xs|sm|md|lg|xl)`.
- **Radius**: sm 4, md 8, lg 12 via `var(--mantine-radius-*)`; `ATLAS_RADIUS_FULL` for pills and circles only.

## Components

- Make everything reusable. Check `src/components/{ui,sidebar,chat,dashboard,charts,search}` before writing new UI.
- Name icons plainly (`PlusIcon`), never with a `SynMaxIcon` prefix; only the logo is `SynMaxIconLogo`. Custom SVGs become components that use `currentColor` and take a `size` prop. Use Untitled UI for anything not supplied.
- Rows without `onClick` are static and get no hover.

## Verify

- Run `npx tsc -b --noEmit` and `npx oxlint src` after changes.
- Delete any temporary `public/_*.html` helpers after use.
